      "created_at": "2019-08-09T18:47:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think that has more to do with assigning power dice; a Genius Power Source gives d6s, because -- although they are very smart -- they aren't actually superhuman in any other aspects.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I would be incredibly surprised if they made a conscious decision to specifically lock anyone with Genius out of being a Gadgeteer. INCREDIBLY surprised.</p>",
